~ keeper
Keeper: Welcome to Haven. I can restore your strength or supply healing potions.
- Buy one potion — 5 gold [if can_buy /] => buy
- Recover fully — free => recovery
- Shop, bank and lessons [if has_progression /] => services
- Ask about work [if quest_work /] => work
- Relive a memory [if mission_offer /] => mission
- About the Undercrypt => advice
- Goodbye => END

~ work
- Hand in a finished quest [if quest_handin /] => handin
- Hear the keeper's offer [if quest_offer /] => offer
- Back => keeper

~ handin
Keeper: You actually finished it. I will record the delivery and pay what was promised. [#service=quest_handin]
=> END

~ offer
Keeper: There is work, if you want it. I will mark the contract accepted in your journal. [#service=quest_offer]
=> END

~ advice
Keeper: Defeat both sentinels to unlock the exit. Rewards remain pending until you leave through it. Consult Field notes for the expedition retention rules before entering.
=> keeper

~ buy
Keeper: Buy one healing potion for 5 gold? It restores up to 15 HP and spends your full activation before rolling. Carry at most five. [#service=buy_potion]
=> END

~ recovery
Keeper: Restore all HP, MP and SP and clear temporary combat effects, at no cost? [#service=recover]
=> END

~ entrance
Undercrypt: Enter the dungeon with your current resources and potions? Recover with the keeper first if you need to.
- Enter the Undercrypt [if can_enter /] => enter
- Stay in Haven => END

~ enter
Undercrypt: Begin this expedition? [#service=enter_dungeon]
=> END

~ abandon
Expedition: Abandon this expedition? All pending gold will be lost. Committed gold and unused potions are retained. [#service=abandon]
=> END

~ services
Keeper: Browse equipment and books, deposit or withdraw gold, or learn Blood Strike for 10 carried gold. Rank advancement is in your Skills panel. [#service=open_services]
=> END

~ mission
Keeper: The warden who sealed the Undercrypt left a memory in this ledger. Step into it, fight as the warden, and I will record what you bring back. Your own gear and training stay untouched outside the memory.
- Enter the memory [if mission_ready /] => mission_enter
- Back => keeper

~ mission_enter
Keeper: The ledger is open. The warden's last stand begins. [#service=mission_enter #mission=mission.defenders_memory]
=> END
